## 4. Animation & UX Layer

Animations should enhance usability without degrading performance.

**Guidelines:**

* GPU-accelerated animations only
* Lightweight highlight overlays
* Locator flash indicators
* Healing event glow effect
* Recorder status indicators

Provide ability to:

* Disable animations
* Switch to low-performance mode

